","section",null,{"className":"bg-[#0c0d12] border border-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2","children":"1. AI-Assisted Extraction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed","children":"ClearPort uses Google Gemini — a large language model with multimodal vision capabilities — to extract structured field data from uploaded trade documents. Gemini performs optical character recognition (OCR) and field-level extraction in a single pass, then a second pass cross-validates fields across documents in the same shipment (e.g. invoice total vs. packing list total)."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-[#0c0d12] border border-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2","children":"2. AI May Make Mistakes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-3","children":"No AI model is perfect. Gemini may produce:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-300","children":"OCR errors"}]," — misreading digits, especially in low-quality scans, multi-page PDFs, or handwritten forms."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-300","children":"Field-level hallucinations"}]," — inferring a value where the source document is ambiguous or incomplete."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-300","children":"Cross-document mismatches"}]," — failing to flag a real discrepancy between the commercial invoice and the bill of lading, or flagging a false one."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-300","children":"HTS classification errors"}]," — the model may suggest a code based on the goods description but the official Harmonized Tariff Schedule is the only authoritative source."]}]]}],"$L2"]}],"$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7"]}],"$L8"]}]}],["$L9"],"$La"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
2:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mt-3","children":"ClearPort mitigates these risks via confidence scoring, threshold-based exception routing, and a structured Exception Desk workflow — but no mitigation eliminates the need for human review."}]
3:["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-[#0c0d12] border border-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2","children":"3. Human Review Is Required"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-3","children":"Before any data exported from ClearPort is used in a customs filing, a qualified customs broker must:"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1.5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Resolve every exception flagged in the Exception Desk — accept, correct, or reject each one. Unresolved exceptions block CSV export by design."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Verify HTS code classifications against the current Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the importing country."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Confirm declared values against the commercial invoice and any related payment instruments."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Cross-check weights, quantities, and units of measure against the packing list and bill of lading."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Verify shipper and consignee details, including addresses and EIN / tax ID numbers, against your records and any applicable denied-party screening."}]]}]]}]
4:["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-[#0c0d12] border border-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2","children":"4. AI Output Is Not Legal Advice"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed","children":"The data ClearPort extracts, the exceptions it flags, and the confidence scores it assigns are operational aids for a licensed customs broker — they are not legal advice and do not constitute a legal opinion on the classification, valuation, or admissibility of any good. For legal advice on a specific shipment, consult a licensed customs attorney."}]]}]
5:["$","section",null,{"className":"bg-[#0c0d12] border border-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-100 mb-2","children":"5. Audit Logging of AI Responses"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed","children":["For traceability and regulatory defense, the system logs every AI extraction event to the ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-amber-400","children":"audit_logs"}]," table. Each log entry records the action type (",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":"[upload]"}],",",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":" [extract]"}],",",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":" [resolve]"}],",",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":" [edit]"}],",",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":" [export]"}],",",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":" [delete]"}],",",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":" [rules]"}],"), the actor (your user ID / email), the affected shipment, and relevant field metadata. These logs are retained indefinitely and can be exported to CSV via the Entry Detail View for compliance audits."]}]]}]
